			'Meek means gentle and humble because you trust our Father, not because you are weak. A meek person has strength and keeps it under His control instead of grabbing, forcing or retaliating. Jesus said, “Blessed are the meek, for they will inherit the earth” (Matthew 5:5).',
	},
	{
		question: 'What is the Greek and Hebrew word for meek?',
